  "description": "Consultation by the London Borough of Camden on extensions and alterations including removal of rooftop plant and additional storey on west side (i.e. a 9 storey building adjacent to Leather Lane - including a 9 storey 'courtyard' extension) and 10 storeys with rooftop plant and terraces on east side (Holborn/Hatton Garden). Facade renewal including new balconies on Holborn Circus elevation. Ground and lower ground floor re-configurations to provide re-configured commercial and retail floorspace (Class E), affordable jewellery workspace and/or competitive socialising (sui generis) on lower ground floor, reconfiguration of entrances and servicing arrangements, new hard and soft landscaping, provision of cycle parking and other ancillary works. (LBC ref. 2025/2446/P).",
